# Manually-exported chart HTML (e.g. figure.to_html() saved to disk for
# ad hoc browser-vs-QWebEngineView comparison during a rendering-bug
# investigation) — a debug/QA artifact, not project content. Added
# after removing one such file (test_chart.html) that had been
# committed to the repo root.
test_chart*.html

# Machine-local runtime configuration. Phase 0.3 of the web-transition
# plan: config/config.yaml carried per-machine state (window geometry,
# recent projects, a named AI provider profile pointing at a local
# environment variable) in a *tracked* file, and the committed copy had
# drifted to a pre-milestone-7 schema. The committed reference is now
# config/config.example.yaml; the live file is generated on first run by
# src/core/config.py and is never committed.
config/config.yaml

# Stray agent git worktrees. Phase 0.4: .claude/worktrees/ accumulated
# registered and unregistered scratch worktrees from delegated agent
# runs; none is project content.
.claude/worktrees/

# Claude Code per-machine settings overrides (not shared).
.claude/settings.local.json

